Build with AI: Expert advice
To use the features covered in this lab, sign into Gemini using your Google Account.

As you follow the instructions in this lab, customize the prompts below to fit your own work.

The skills you learn in this lab will help you generate better ideas faster, gain new perspectives, and more easily share knowledge with your team. 

Lab tasks:
Step 1: Explore a persona
Click the “New chat” button to start a new chat with Gemini. Then, paste the prompt below and replace the text in [brackets] with details relevant to your own work.

What are the key characteristics of [an expert role relevant to your work, e.g. a highly competent interior designer]?

Read Gemini’s response, then select and copy it. You will use the response and its insights to create the persona for your custom AI expert.

Step 2: Create a custom expert in Gemini
In the top left corner of the Gemini app, click "New Chat" to start a new chat thread.

Then, paste the text below into the instructions box, replacing the text in [brackets] with Gemini’s output from Step 1.

You are [expert role, e.g. a highly competent interior designer]. Your key characteristics include: [characteristics from Gemini’s output in the previous step]. I am a [your role]. Use your expertise to challenge my thinking and ensure my ideas are sound. Your advice should be clear, candid, and informative. Stay in character throughout the conversation.

Step 3: Ask your custom AI expert questions
Start a new chat with your AI expert to try it out. You can use it to get advice, solicit feedback on an idea, or answer questions related to its expertise. For example:

What are the top factors to consider in selecting a [product or service offered by your company]?

You can pin your expert AI chat thread in Gemini, so you can easily access it and re-use it in the future. To pin your expert AI chat, follow these steps:

Navigate to the left-side panel of Gemini

Click the three dots next to the expert chat thread

Select the pin icon

Next steps: 
Think about how you might be able to use this custom AI expert in your work, or what other experts could be useful for you. 

